{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":39459,\"title\":\"The Oklahoma Kid\",\"tagline\":\"Greater Than \\\"Cimarron\\\" - Packed with Thrills - Loaded with Action . . . As an Exciting page from American history is unfolded upon the screen !\",\"overview\":\"McCord's gang robs the stage carrying money to pay Indians for their land, and the notorious outlaw \\\"The Oklahoma Kid\\\" Jim Kincaid takes the money from McCord. McCord stakes a \\\"sooner\\\" claim on land which is to be used for a new town; in exchange for giving it up, he gets control of gambling and saloons. When Kincaid's father runs for mayor, McCord incites a mob to lynch the old man whom McCord has already framed for murder.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/EryVBlv0KH7m2RBzyoxuTrhZUV.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9QMxQYORVAn3xdxlMO9m5bUkaFN.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"voteCount\":35,\"year\":1939,\"runtime\":85,\"genres\":[\"Western\",\"History\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Lloyd Bacon\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":21305,\"name\":\"Lloyd Bacon\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1QUVvrHdXO61OlyxlqOXGyb4645.jpg\"},{\"id\":5788,\"name\":\"James Cagney\",\"character\":\"Jim Kincaid\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/haDKecHGGb1qh8gAoR3ExiJlujn.jpg\"},{\"id\":4110,\"name\":\"Humphrey Bogart\",\"character\":\"Whip McCord\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4pk2VbOb2td7iBZyir6Ji46HH4N.jpg\"},{\"id\":33021,\"name\":\"Rosemary Lane\",\"character\":\"Jane Hardwick\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cKIdMUBI4UlwSg3PQ4dh5ZtwNdJ.jpg\"},{\"id\":8841,\"name\":\"Donald Crisp\",\"character\":\"Judge Hardwick\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/MEPq09iLEwJVrxw1T97qOILhk6.jpg\"},{\"id\":114097,\"name\":\"Harvey Stephens\",\"character\":\"Ned Kincaid\",\"photo\":\"https://image