is Montana reservation.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Western\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":13470,\"title\":\"Bury My Heart at Wounded Knee\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/w8FeAVNxe17rQUqaBhKy5F0wpBf.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rEovUFDH1BSNipOt5T80G8FDGs.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Beginning just after the bloody Sioux victory over General Custer at Little Big Horn, the story is told through two unique perspectives: Charles Eastman, a young, white-educated Sioux doctor held up as living proof of the alleged success of assimilation, and Sitting Bull the proud Lakota chief whose tribe won the American Indians’ last major victory at Little Big Horn.\",\"genres\":[\"Western\",\"Drama\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":396373,\"title\":\"Woman Walks Ahead\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qI5NcQHR0nsykPqlG2qnfFyMgW6.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eFpSaFzmP916Vf0QdEJSE9M0uOO.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Based on a true story, this riveting western follows a headstrong New York widow as she journeys west to meet Sioux chief Sitting Bull, facing off with an army officer intent on war with Native Americans.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"History\",\"Western\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":766431,\"title\":\"Hostile Territory\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pSgLSxoAG1Dt91dUSwnaKETmseW.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dTF2nIQ25fFDUgd8YBOZXMIbxHf.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Former P.O.W. Jack Calgrove moves Heaven and Earth to be reunited with his children following the Civil War. After returning home, Jack discovers that his wife has tragically died and his children, presumed to be orphans, are heading deep into the West on a train crossing enemy lines, with the intent of being placed into new homes. Calgrove and another soldier team up with a troop of Native American sharpshooters and a freed slave as they try to stop the train.\",\"genres\":[\"Western\",\"Action\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":666219,\"title\":\"Emperor\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/s6BMM5UjC9fqGWqlzeWCHJjBNyy.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/A3AwrEznb3YEv68VPGHtRIAs913.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An escaped slave travels north and has chance encounters with Frederick Douglass and John Brown. Based on the life story of Shields Green.\",\"genres\":[\"History\",\"War\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":24241,\"title\":\"And Starring Pancho Villa as Himself\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aPXm56o3tEQdk0QTR6sZzmyw4f5.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1j1HWW08eYsVNw6zDX5aBoLAhmx.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In 1914, the Mexican revolutionary Pancho Villa invites studios to shoot his actual battles against Porfírio Diaz army to raise funds for financing guns and ammunition. The Mutual Film Corporation, through producer D.W. Griffith, interests for the proposition and sends the filmmaker Frank Thayer to negotiate a contract with Pancho Villa himself.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"History\",\"War\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":205,\"title\":\"Hotel Rwanda\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/p3pHw85UMZPegfMZBA6dZ06yarm.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jkvvXaN7FPVKGlk8oj9PL0FHNtj.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Inspired by true events, this film takes place in Rwanda in the 1990s when more than a million Tutsis were killed in a genocide that went mostly unnoticed by the rest of the world. Hotel owner Paul Rusesabagina houses over a thousand refuges in his hotel in attempt to save their lives.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"History\",\"War\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":644495,\"title\":\"House of Gucci\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2WFMS4v0oiDMtkeZQTdmiamjyaR.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6VZF8JVNOgJX56WCapYaqcVQiAw.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When Patrizia Reggiani, an outsider from humble beginnings, marries into the Gucci family, her unbridled ambition begins to unravel the family legacy and triggers a reckless spiral of betrayal, decadence, revenge, and ultimately… murder.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":6038,\"title\":\"Shanghai Knights\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vVNQStMlZS9mn2AKBEpadRunHgt.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AoXqOWzD0HGZttYi0wHMvvGJZhZ.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When a Chinese rebel murders Chon's estranged father and escapes to England, Chon and Roy make their way to London with revenge on their minds.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\",\"Western\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"BZGjwDLKZlQ\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"ZkNdbJxZZiE\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"k9-0cJ6tQbg\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}